The file-tree built-in symbols in icons.rs and the diff status symbols in
diff/view/chrome.rs are adapted from the installed @pierre/trees and @pierre/diffs
packages, respectively, under Apache-2.0 (see PIERRE-LICENSE).

Original SVG paths are retained; Rust wrappers and semantic colors are OpenCodex
adaptations. The Hugeicons controls in icons.rs use the same glyph paths as the
existing web application and native chat icons.
